{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PhotoDirector 2025 Ultra</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize AI tools to optimize image quality through fine resolution adjustments and seamless editing capabilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Image Enhancer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effortlessly restore facial features to pristine clarity. Regardless of whether you're upscaling vintage snapshots or simply looking to add an extra touch of detail, our innovative technology ensures that every facial feature is beautifully restored, or brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/bb65d2d6d81fa1b7b685712d98416e3e.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/bb65d2d6d81fa1b7b685712d98416e3e.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Object Removal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate unwanted objects and people from photos leaving no trace they were ever there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/8647141ec7233cca4c676d1fdfc8d55c.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/8647141ec7233cca4c676d1fdfc8d55c.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Background Removal and Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove backgrounds and edit your own, all at once. Edit background color, blur, or import images, including AI backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/84f470abb63c08ae6a0e377d366252d9.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/84f470abb63c08ae6a0e377d366252d9.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One-click Face Retouch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look your best with the perfect combination of photo retouching edits instantly applied in a single click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/4b82306bcb41564b4be758af93708663.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/4b82306bcb41564b4be758af93708663.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Face Deblur</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unblur faces in photos and maintain background blur to create a natural focal point in close-range shots, such as portraits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/461d4816ef3a3d2d26586ef4bdd37267.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/461d4816ef3a3d2d26586ef4bdd37267.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtually reshape and refine your face. Remove wrinkles and shine, or whiten teeth. Change the width of the face. Reduce or enhance forehead, jaw, and chin details with shaper tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/a2d616854f6e8994fb79e1eba9809ab0.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/a2d616854f6e8994fb79e1eba9809ab0.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Auto-Tone Refinement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the brightness and contrast of your shots whilst also making sure the details are rich and vivid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/2e56308edb13313018f945b3115dc8da.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/2e56308edb13313018f945b3115dc8da.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Style Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of AI to turn any photo into a mosaic, sketch, watercolor, or oil painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/a194442dace60734e3bce74ae55b1310.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/a194442dace60734e3bce74ae55b1310.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blur Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add different customizable blur styles to your images with circular, linear, and brush tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/979bd00d1ccd8dd1aa18f316063e95f9.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/979bd00d1ccd8dd1aa18f316063e95f9.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Layer Masks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-destructive photo compositing tool for hiding portions of a layer and revealing portions of the layer below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/d9e5878824fc39f71ae1d527b5c54777.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/d9e5878824fc39f71ae1d527b5c54777.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3146030?t=1773143485","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773143485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/305fa530d75d6fe0ecd86139333b113ab4b1adc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773143485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/305fa530d75d6fe0ecd86139333b113ab4b1adc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773143485","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PhotoDirector 2025 Ultra</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize AI tools to optimize image quality through fine resolution adjustments and seamless editing capabilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Image Enhancer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effortlessly restore facial features to pristine clarity. Regardless of whether you're upscaling vintage snapshots or simply looking to add an extra touch of detail, our innovative technology ensures that every facial feature is beautifully restored, or brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/bb65d2d6d81fa1b7b685712d98416e3e.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/bb65d2d6d81fa1b7b685712d98416e3e.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Object Removal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate unwanted objects and people from photos leaving no trace they were ever there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/8647141ec7233cca4c676d1fdfc8d55c.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/8647141ec7233cca4c676d1fdfc8d55c.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Background Removal and Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove backgrounds and edit your own, all at once. Edit background color, blur, or import images, including AI backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/84f470abb63c08ae6a0e377d366252d9.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/84f470abb63c08ae6a0e377d366252d9.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One-click Face Retouch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look your best with the perfect combination of photo retouching edits instantly applied in a single click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/4b82306bcb41564b4be758af93708663.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/4b82306bcb41564b4be758af93708663.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Face Deblur</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unblur faces in photos and maintain background blur to create a natural focal point in close-range shots, such as portraits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/461d4816ef3a3d2d26586ef4bdd37267.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/461d4816ef3a3d2d26586ef4bdd37267.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtually reshape and refine your face. Remove wrinkles and shine, or whiten teeth. Change the width of the face. Reduce or enhance forehead, jaw, and chin details with shaper tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/a2d616854f6e8994fb79e1eba9809ab0.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/a2d616854f6e8994fb79e1eba9809ab0.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Auto-Tone Refinement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the brightness and contrast of your shots whilst also making sure the details are rich and vivid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/2e56308edb13313018f945b3115dc8da.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/2e56308edb13313018f945b3115dc8da.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Style Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of AI to turn any photo into a mosaic, sketch, watercolor, or oil painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/a194442dace60734e3bce74ae55b1310.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/a194442dace60734e3bce74ae55b1310.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blur Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add different customizable blur styles to your images with circular, linear, and brush tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/979bd00d1ccd8dd1aa18f316063e95f9.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/979bd00d1ccd8dd1aa18f316063e95f9.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Layer Masks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-destructive photo compositing tool for hiding portions of a layer and revealing portions of the layer below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras/d9e5878824fc39f71ae1d527b5c54777.avif?t=1773143485\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/extras_big/d9e5878824fc39f71ae1d527b5c54777.avif?t=1773143485 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Cyberlink"],"genres":[{"description":"Photo Editing","id":"55"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146030/header.jpg?t=1773143485","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 and developed by Cyberlink Corporation. Published by PLAION GmbH, Austria. PLAION GmbH and its respective logos are trademarks of PLAION GmbH. PowerDirector, Cyberlink and their respective logo are trademarks of Cyberlink Corporation. All other trademarks, logos and copyrights are property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><b